      "problem": "If ![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/differential/14116975/assets/8639fb58fd989253bb0095f58c39189ce653683c908d22a787c7454447ae706c.svg) and ![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/differential/14116975/assets/24145ff5ab9076ec70b5e8f57304bd93e507154b5ad7cb61b5a580445fdad3dd.svg) then what is $\\mathbf{u} \\cdot \\mathbf{v}?$",
